Pine v6 structured signature + behavior data
=============================================

Source:  https://github.com/folknor/pine-tools, pine-data/v6/*.json
License: MIT (folknor owns pine-tools)

Files in this directory are point-in-time snapshots of pine-tools'
data-pipeline output (`pnpm run scrape` plus `pnpm run discover:behavior`).
They originate from crawling and parsing TradingView's published Pine v6
documentation; trademarks belong to TradingView.

Files:
  - functions.json          (~457 entries) function signatures, params, returns, flags
  - variables.json          (~90 entries)  built-in variables (close, high, time)
  - constants.json          (~237 entries) constants (color.red, shape.circle)
  - keywords.json           (~28 entries)  reserved keywords
  - function-behavior.json  per-function polymorphism + argument-ordering markers

Snapshot date: see git log for this directory's introducing commit and
function-behavior.json's `generatedAt` field for the upstream generation
timestamp.

Refresh procedure: re-run pine-tools' data pipeline, copy the resulting
JSON files in, commit with a note about which scrape revision is current.
